# dependencies
# 注意：必须用 **/ 递归匹配。无斜杠的 `node_modules` 只匹配根目录，
# pnpm workspace 的嵌套依赖（packages/@magicclass/*/node_modules）会被漏掉，
# 而它们是 Windows junction 软链接，拷进 Linux 镜像后失效，
# 会遮蔽容器内 pnpm 正确安装的包，导致 next build 报 "Module not found"。
**/node_modules
**/.pnpm-store

# build output（同样递归：packages/*/dist 都是构建产物，由 postinstall 重新生成）
**/.next
**/out
**/build
**/dist

# git
.git
.gitignore

# IDE
.idea
.vscode

# env & secrets
.env*
!.env.example
server-providers*.yml

# misc
assets
*.md
*.pdf
*.pem
.DS_Store
.vercel
coverage
logs
data
docs
.claude

# isolated MP4 render service — built as its own image (render-service/Dockerfile),
# never part of the main app image.
render-service
